WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.201
Iranian officials say that

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.435
their air defenses

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.371
repelled every single Russian

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:06.473
air attack on Kiev earlier today.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.741
The most intense barrage

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.175
on Ukraine's capital

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.977
since the start of this year.

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:12.412
CNN's Nic Robertson is live

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:13.580
for us in eastern Ukraine.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:13.780
And Nic,

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.415
how are Ukrainians gearing up

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:19.352
for this anticipated counter offensive?

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:21.755
Yeah, most people here are wondering

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:22.622
where it's going to start,

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.523
when it's going to start.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.558
They've heard so much about it.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.860
They obviously look at these

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.460
drone strikes

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.461
coming from

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.362
coming from Moscow,

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:33.400
the one in Odessa, 15 of 15 drones fire

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.302
that 1212 were shot down on the tail

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.037
fins were written.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:37.804
The message

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:38.738
from Moscow,

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:39.706
from the Kremlin,

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.142
an apparent reference to this alleged

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.311
assassination attempt on President Putin.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.679
But for that counter offensive

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.481
you're talking about,

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.683
the government is not saying anything.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.552
But what we've been witnessing

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:53.219
are troops

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.687
getting ready,

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.957
very ready for that moment when it comes.

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:01.995
Ukraine's counter

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:04.330
offensive is edging closer.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.668
Momentum building at secret locations.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.272
These battle hardened stormtroopers

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.474
in live fire training,

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.576
honing tactics

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.911
to take trenches

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.246
just miles from the front lines

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.948
where they often put their own

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:25.351
lives on the line.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.756
Vlad shows us video of him

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.659
storming Russian trenches a few days ago.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.862
This was as he starts up,

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:38.031
he shouts to the Russian troops

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:39.599
to surrender.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.769
Get down to it.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.472
They shoot back.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.640
The fight continues

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.976
in your every single day.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.412
They wouldn't surrender, he says.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.813
We killed three of them

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:55.315
with our grenades.

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:57.984
When you're already fighting so well,

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.252
what's the point of doing

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.154
extra training like this?

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:01.654
But in the end,

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.923
you can't do enough training, he says.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:07.260
You must do it all the time to be ready.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.130
There is every possibility

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.698
the next time these troops

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:12.966
go back to the front line,

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.734
it could be part of

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.003
the big counteroffensive operation.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.705
They don't know.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:19.772
And their commanders

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.874
certainly aren't saying.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.009
Most of

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.445
these troops in their early twenties,

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:27.480
the U.S.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.915
made and 113

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:32.185
they're training with a 60 year veteran

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:34.420
of the type of infantry assault

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.422
they'll need to punch through

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:39.826
Russian lines, train and train again.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.595
Drilled into these young warriors.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.698
It's never enough

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:48.735
to do like you must training every day.

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:50.803
If you're not training, you will die.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.505
That simple? Yeah.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.306
And have you seen.

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:54.174
You've been in the front line.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.209
Have you lost friends?

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.211
Yeah, I lost a couple of friends.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:01.114
And I don't know what to say.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:02.315
It's terrible

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.350
psychologically.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.352
You know, that could be you.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.621
Uh, yeah, but, like,

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.657
we all can die in one way.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:13.359
That's it for me.

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:14.460
It's nice and quick.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.361
Okay,

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.397
so what I'd find with my country,

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:19.265
I'm dying like a hero. It's okay for me.

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:23.169
Confidence here has been hard earned.

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.639
Camaraderie cemented in action,

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.709
the test of their training coming.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.812
The only question when,

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.649
like.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:37.617
So when Ukrainians

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:39.752
see those and more than one phrase

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:41.354
lined up along their highways

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.822
or the British made masters

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:43.890
or the US made

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.624
em wrap

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:46.226
these important infantry

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:48.127
fighting vehicles to take territory.

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:49.762
When they see those convoys

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.864
moving on the highways here,

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:52.699
they're going to know

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:54.000
this counteroffensive

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.169
is getting pretty close Jake.

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:57.303
All right, Nic

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:58.905
Robertson in eastern Ukraine for us,

00:03:58.905 --> 00:03:59.539
thank you so much.

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:01.040
Joining us now to discuss,

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.375
the Ukrainian ambassador

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.911
to the United States, Oksana Markova.

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:05.878
Madam Ambassador,

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.013
thank you for joining us.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.948
What do you make of these

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.383
obviously baseless claims

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:11.084
by Russia

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:11.851
that Ukraine,

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:14.153
now the United States is behind

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:17.824
the alleged drone attack at the Kremlin?

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:18.458
Thank you.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.193
Thank you very much, Jake, for having me.

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.928
Well, this will not be the first time

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:22.895
Russia is lying.

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:26.733
They have been lying during all 435 days

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.068
since they re invaded us

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:31.304
and all this horrible war crimes.

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:33.239
Ukraine has been very clear.

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:34.507
That is is a

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:36.509
no way, way involved in this attack.

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:38.144
We don't know what it is.

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:40.146
We don't know whether it's a provocation

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:41.581
organized by their forces

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:43.383
or whoever did that.

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:45.718
But what Ukraine is doing, again,

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:47.086
for more than 400 days

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:48.087
now is defending

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:50.156
our country on our territory

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:52.825
and the Russian terrorist attacks.

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.527
Those are the real terrorist attacks.

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:57.063
We have seen them since February 24th

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:58.164
last year

00:04:58.164 --> 00:04:59.232
with missiles,

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:01.200
with drones, with striking drones

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.635
and everything else.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.304
We just saw our reporter in Ukraine

00:05:04.304 --> 00:05:05.972
showing us how elite

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:06.639
Ukrainian troops

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:07.540
are preparing

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.074
and training

00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:10.877
for this expected counter offensive.

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:12.712
The US director of National Intelligence,

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:13.613
Avril Haines,

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.014
testified to Congress today

00:05:15.014 --> 00:05:17.116
on that topic. Take a listen.

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:20.820
But even if Ukraine's counteroffensive

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.322
is not fully successful,

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.090
the Russians are unlikely to be able

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:24.490
to mount

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.259
a significant offensive operation

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.226
this year.

00:05:27.226 --> 00:05:27.660
In fact,

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.928
if Russia does not initiate

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.430
a mandatory mobilization

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.532
and secure substantial third

00:05:32.532 --> 00:05:34.901
party ammunition supplies beyond existing

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:37.103
deliveries from Iran and others,

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.805
it will be increasingly challenging

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:39.138
for them

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:40.540
to sustain even modest

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.575
offensive operations.

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:44.477
Do you do you agree with that assessment,

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:45.311
Madam Ambassador?

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:45.912
Do you think it's going

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.914
to be tough for Russia to sustain even,

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:51.551
even modest offensive operations?

00:05:51.551 --> 00:05:53.953
Well, we have seen them failing miserably

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:55.955
since the offensive.

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:57.423
But since their offensive started,

00:05:57.423 --> 00:05:59.492
this is their war started.

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:01.361
We already liberated more than half

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:02.829
of what they have taken.

00:06:02.829 --> 00:06:03.830
We liberated.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.898
They were not able to take Kiev

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:08.101
in three days as they wanted to.

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:09.001
But on the other hand,

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:11.771
we don't want to underestimate the enemy.

00:06:11.771 --> 00:06:13.439
I mean, it's still a brutal aggressor

00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:14.974
with a lot of weapons

00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:16.743
and we see on a daily basis

00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:18.144
what they are capable of

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:19.579
when they are not

00:06:19.579 --> 00:06:21.080
capable in winning

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.216
on the front lines in a fair battle,

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.084
they just resort to violence

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:27.120
and kill, rape,

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.888
kidnap our Ukrainian children.

00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:31.657
So we are motivated, unlike them.

00:06:31.657 --> 00:06:32.859
That is true. And

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:36.028
regardless, again, of the fact

00:06:36.829 --> 00:06:38.431
whether we have enough weapons

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:39.932
or do not have enough weapons,

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.401
there is no other choice for us.

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:42.535
We will continue

00:06:42.535 --> 00:06:45.271
defending our country until the force

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:46.439
sovereignty is restored

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:48.641
and until Russians are out of our land.

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:52.378
Where are the Ukrainian people?

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.713
Where is the Ukrainian military

00:06:53.713 --> 00:06:55.081
when it comes to the many requests

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:59.485
you've made for jets, for tanks?

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:03.156
Has anything arrived in the country

00:07:03.456 --> 00:07:06.759
in a way that you're able to use?

00:07:07.059 --> 00:07:08.127
Well, we are discussing

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:10.730
all the capabilities with our our friends

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.632
and especially with the U.S. here.

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:15.268
You have seen the last Ramstein Medien,

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:16.502
for which we are grateful

00:07:16.502 --> 00:07:17.737
personally to Secretary

00:07:17.737 --> 00:07:20.206
Western, who takes time and every month

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.074
not only participates

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.409
in bilateral discussions

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:24.844
with us, but gathers

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:25.978
more than 50 countries

00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:27.213
now to discuss together

00:07:27.213 --> 00:07:28.281
what can we do more?

00:07:28.281 --> 00:07:31.150
So some of the items

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.685
we already see on the battlefields,

00:07:32.685 --> 00:07:33.453
like Bradleys

00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:34.320
and others,

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.489
we already see them in Ukraine.

00:07:36.489 --> 00:07:38.124
Some we will surprise Russians

00:07:39.091 --> 00:07:39.992
when they will

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:41.260
see them in the battlefield

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.762
and somewhere still discussing.

00:07:42.762 --> 00:07:45.031
But we do need all the capabilities

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:45.932
in order

00:07:45.932 --> 00:07:48.201
not only to defend the country now,

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:50.403
but also to build the enduring strength

00:07:50.403 --> 00:07:51.504
for the future.

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:53.439
Because unless

00:07:53.439 --> 00:07:55.074
some miracle happens in Russia,

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:57.009
they will continue to be a threat

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:59.312
to all of us, all democratic countries.

00:07:59.412 --> 00:08:00.780
So Politico is reporting

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.881
that Ukrainian officials

00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:02.215
in Kiev

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:02.915
are withholding

00:08:02.915 --> 00:08:05.251
details of the counteroffensive

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:08.120
from allies, perhaps understandably,

00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:09.722
citing concerns

00:08:09.722 --> 00:08:11.057
over the recent leaks

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:12.658
of highly classified U.S.

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:14.460
documents.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.262
I mean, it makes sense.

00:08:16.262 --> 00:08:17.730
I'm not faulting you.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.832
You wouldn't want more than a few

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:20.633
key people to know

00:08:20.633 --> 00:08:21.300
the time and place

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.636
of any planned counter offensive.

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:25.705
But this does seem to suggest

00:08:25.705 --> 00:08:26.272
that the leak

00:08:26.272 --> 00:08:30.076
did some serious damage on the U.S.

00:08:30.109 --> 00:08:31.043
Ukraine intelligence

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:33.045
sharing relationship.

00:08:33.913 --> 00:08:34.714
I would disagree.

00:08:34.714 --> 00:08:36.649
I think that trust and cooperation

00:08:36.649 --> 00:08:39.318
between our countries is at the levels

00:08:39.318 --> 00:08:40.820
we never had before.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.922
And I think it's understandable

00:08:43.122 --> 00:08:44.023
that we will not

00:08:44.023 --> 00:08:47.093
never talk publicly about neither

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:47.960
what we planned

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.161
for the counteroffensive

00:08:49.161 --> 00:08:51.063
or what do we share with each other.

00:08:51.063 --> 00:08:53.766
But Ukraine is very

00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:56.002
happy with the cooperation and with how

00:08:56.002 --> 00:08:57.069
we together

00:08:57.069 --> 00:08:59.438
are working to defend our country.

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:01.407
Ukrainian ambassador to the United States

00:09:01.407 --> 00:09:02.975
Oksana Markova, always an honor

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:04.076
to have you. Thank you so much.

